{"seq":3,"slug":"imaging-biomarkers","title":"博士转化医学 — 影像生物标志物","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/biomarker-discovery/imaging-biomarkers","wordCount":1992,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士转化医学-影像生物标志物\">博士转化医学 — 影像生物标志物</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>影像生物标志物利用医学影像技术非侵入性地定量组织的结构和功能特征，为疾病诊断、分期、治疗监测和预后评估提供空间分辨的信息。与分子生物标志物相比，影像标志物的独特价值在于提供整个病灶（甚至全身）的空间异质性信息，而不仅仅是单一组织样本的分子快照。</p>\n<p>影像生物标志物的技术分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模态</th>\n<th>物理原理</th>\n<th>空间分辨率</th>\n<th>功能信息</th>\n<th>临床应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CT</td>\n<td>X 射线衰减</td>\n<td>~0.5mm</td>\n<td>灌注 CT（血流动力学）</td>\n<td>形态学评估、RECIST</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MRI</td>\n<td>核磁共振弛豫</td>\n<td>~1mm</td>\n<td>DWI（扩散）、DCE（灌注）、MRS（代谢）</td>\n<td>软组织对比、多参数成像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PET</td>\n<td>正电子湮灭</td>\n<td>~4mm</td>\n<td>代谢活性、受体结合</td>\n<td>FDG 摄取、分子靶标成像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超声</td>\n<td>声波反射</td>\n<td>~0.3mm</td>\n<td>弹性成像、CEUS（造影增强）</td>\n<td>实时、床旁、无辐射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[医学影像采集] --&gt; B[标准化预处理&lt;br/&gt;重采样/归一化]&#10;    B --&gt; C{分析路径}&#10;    C --&gt;|定量参数| D[功能参数提取&lt;br/&gt;ADC/SUV/Ktrans]&#10;    C --&gt;|影像组学| E[高维特征提取&lt;br/&gt;形状/纹理/小波]&#10;    C --&gt;|深度学习| F[端到端模型&lt;br/&gt;CNN/ViT]&#10;    D --&gt; G[生物标志物验证]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[临床决策整合]\">graph TD\n    A[医学影像采集] --&gt; B[标准化预处理&lt;br/&gt;重采样/归一化]\n    B --&gt; C{分析路径}\n    C --&gt;|定量参数| D[功能参数提取&lt;br/&gt;ADC/SUV/Ktrans]\n    C --&gt;|影像组学| E[高维特征提取&lt;br/&gt;形状/纹理/小波]\n    C --&gt;|深度学习| F[端到端模型&lt;br/&gt;CNN/ViT]\n    D --&gt; G[生物标志物验证]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[临床决策整合]</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"功能性影像参数\">功能性影像参数</h3><p>功能性影像提供超越形态学的组织生物学信息。主要参数及其生物学含义：</p>\n<p><strong>扩散加权成像（DWI/ADC）</strong>：</p>\n<p>表观扩散系数（ADC）反映组织中水分子的自由运动程度。肿瘤组织由于细胞密度高，水分子扩散受限，ADC 值降低。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(b) = S_0 \\cdot \\exp(-b \\cdot ADC)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 b 值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 时的信号强度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时的信号。通过多个 b 值拟合获得 ADC 图。</p>\n<p><strong>高级扩散模型</strong>突破了单指数假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>IVIM（体素内不相干运动）</strong>：分离组织扩散和微循环灌注：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(b) = S_0[f \\cdot \\exp(-bD^*) + (1-f) \\cdot \\exp(-bD)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>DKI（扩散峰度成像）</strong>：捕捉非高斯扩散，反映组织微结构复杂度</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>动态对比增强 MRI（DCE-MRI）</strong>：</p>\n<p>Tofts 模型是 DCE-MRI 药代动力学分析的标准模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_t(t) = K^{trans} \\int_0^t C_p(\\tau) \\cdot \\exp\\left[-\\frac{K^{trans}}{v_e}(t-\\tau)\\right] d\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4554em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5435em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4206em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4706em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是组织对比剂浓度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是血浆输入函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^{trans}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是容积转移常数（反映血管通透性），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是细胞外容积分数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^{trans}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 升高提示血管通透性增加（新生血管化），是抗血管生成治疗疗效监测的核心参数。</p>\n<p><strong>PET 标准化摄取值（SUV）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>tissue</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>injected</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>body</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SUV = \\frac{C_{\\text{tissue}}}{D_{\\text{injected}} / W_{\\text{body}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">injected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">body</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tissue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>SUVmax 是肿瘤代谢活性的粗略指标，广泛用于 FDG-PET。但 SUV 受多种技术因素影响（注射剂量准确性、摄取时间、血糖水平），定量研究中需要严格的采集标准化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"影像组学-radiomics\">影像组学（Radiomics）</h3><p>影像组学从标准医学影像中高通量提取定量特征，将影像信息转化为可挖掘的高维数据。典型的影像组学工作流：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>感兴趣区分割（ROI Segmentation）</strong>：手动、半自动或 AI 辅助勾画肿瘤边界</li>\n<li><strong>特征提取</strong>：通常提取 100-2,000 个特征</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征类别</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>形状特征</td>\n<td>体积、表面积、球形度、伸长度</td>\n<td>~15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一阶统计</td>\n<td>均值、偏度、峰度、熵</td>\n<td>~20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纹理特征（GLCM）</td>\n<td>对比度、均匀性、相关性</td>\n<td>~25</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纹理特征（GLRLM）</td>\n<td>行程长度非均匀性</td>\n<td>~15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小波变换</td>\n<td>各频带子特征</td>\n<td>~750</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><strong>特征选择与建模</strong>：与组学标志物发现相同的统计方法（LASSO、随机森林等）</li>\n<li><strong>独立验证</strong>：多中心验证是影像组学研究的关键瓶颈</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>影像组学的可重复性危机</strong>：</p>\n<p>影像组学面临严峻的可重复性问题。特征值对以下因素高度敏感：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>扫描参数（层厚、矩阵、重建核）</li>\n<li>扫描仪厂商和型号</li>\n<li>分割方法和操作者间变异</li>\n<li>重采样和量化参数</li>\n</ul>\n<p>IBSI（Image Biomarker Standardisation Initiative）制定了特征计算的标准化规范，是解决这一问题的重要进展。</p>\n<h3 id=\"放射基因组学-radiogenomics\">放射基因组学（Radiogenomics）</h3><p>放射基因组学建立影像表型与分子特征之间的映射关系，目标是通过非侵入性影像推断肿瘤的分子状态。</p>\n<p><strong>经典案例</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>胶质瘤 MRI 特征 → IDH 突变状态和 MGMT 甲基化预测</li>\n<li>非小细胞肺癌 CT 纹理 → EGFR 突变和 ALK 重排预测</li>\n<li>乳腺癌 DCE-MRI 增强模式 → 分子亚型分类</li>\n</ul>\n<p>放射基因组学的方法论挑战与传统影像组学相似但更突出：样本量通常较小（需要影像+基因组配对数据），特征空间极高维，过拟合风险极大。严格的多中心外部验证和预注册分析计划是可信度的前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"深度学习影像标志物\">深度学习影像标志物</h3><p>深度学习（CNN, Vision Transformer）绕过了人工特征工程，直接从原始影像中学习预测性表征。代表性进展：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>模型架构</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>临床状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>皮肤镜黑色素瘤</td>\n<td>Inception V3</td>\n<td>AUC ~0.95</td>\n<td>FDA 批准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视网膜糖网筛查</td>\n<td>Deep ensemble</td>\n<td>Se 87%, Sp 98%</td>\n<td>FDA 批准（IDx-DR）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低剂量肺 CT 结节</td>\n<td>3D CNN</td>\n<td>AUC ~0.94</td>\n<td>研究阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>病理 WSI 分级</td>\n<td>Attention MIL</td>\n<td>AUC ~0.97</td>\n<td>商业产品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>生成式 AI 在影像标志物中的新兴应用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>合成数据增强：GAN/扩散模型生成训练数据，缓解稀有病灶的数据不足</li>\n<li>跨模态转换：从 CT 预测 PET 信号，减少患者辐射暴露</li>\n<li>不确定性量化：贝叶斯神经网络或 MC Dropout 提供预测置信度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一个多参数 MRI 的肝细胞癌预后标志物研究：使用 DWI（ADC）、DCE-MRI（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^{trans}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和 T1 mapping 三个功能参数。讨论每个参数的生物学含义、标准化采集方案，以及如何将三个参数整合为复合标志物。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某影像组学模型在单中心回顾性数据上报告 AUC = 0.92，但在外部中心降至 0.71。列出至少 5 个可能的原因（从技术到方法论），并为每个原因设计诊断方法和校正策略。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较影像组学和深度学习方法在以下场景的适用性：(a) 单中心 100 例小样本研究，(b) 多中心 5,000 例大规模研究，(c) 需要向临床医生解释预测依据的决策支持场景。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>放射基因组学试图用影像替代分子检测。讨论这一目标的合理性边界：在什么精度水平下影像预测的分子状态可以指导治疗决策？与直接分子检测相比，影像替代方法的成本-效益分析如何开展？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Lambin et al. (2017)</strong>：<em>Radiomics: the bridge between medical imaging and personalized medicine</em>（Nature Reviews Clinical Oncology）— 影像组学综述</li>\n<li><strong>IBSI</strong>：<em>Image biomarker standardisation initiative</em>（Radiology, 2020）— 特征计算标准化</li>\n<li><strong>Bi et al. (2019)</strong>：<em>Artificial intelligence in medicine: the insider&#39;s guide to deep learning in radiology</em>（AJR）— 深度学习影像分析入门</li>\n<li><strong>Aerts et al. (2014)</strong>：<em>Decoding tumour phenotype by noninvasive imaging using a quantitative radiomics approach</em>（Nature Communications）— 影像组学的开创性研究</li>\n<li><strong>PyRadiomics</strong>（开源 Python 库）：影像组学特征提取的标准工具</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>影像生物标志物通过功能成像参数、影像组学和深度学习三条路径将医学影像从定性观察转变为定量分析。ADC、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^{trans}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 SUV 等功能参数提供组织生物学信息，影像组学通过高维特征提取捕捉人眼不可见的纹理模式，深度学习则实现端到端的预测建模。可重复性和多中心验证是影像标志物进入临床的核心瓶颈——IBSI 标准化和严格的外部验证流程是解决这一问题的关键步骤。放射基因组学的&quot;影像替代分子检测&quot;愿景既充满前景，也需要在临床效用层面而非仅在准确度层面获得验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士转化医学 — 影像生物标志物","id":"博士转化医学-影像生物标志物"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"功能性影像参数","id":"功能性影像参数"},{"level":3,"text":"影像组学（Radiomics）","id":"影像组学-radiomics"},{"level":3,"text":"放射基因组学（Radiogenomics）","id":"放射基因组学-radiogenomics"},{"level":3,"text":"深度学习影像标志物","id":"深度学习影像标志物"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士转化医学 — 液体活检与循环肿瘤 DNA","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/biomarker-discovery/liquid-biopsy-ctdna"},"next":{"title":"博士转化医学 — 基因治疗载体工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy/gene-therapy-vectors"}}